{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make it a legal requirement to have a fire extinguisher in your house.",
        "additional_details": "This petition is about decreasing the risks of a house fire and people dying from fires. Not only can it be used in house holds, but a fire extinguisher can be used in near by fields or woodlands. Fire fighters may not have the time to get to your house, so it is always a wise idea to have a back up option.",
        "background": "We want the Uk government to make it a legal requirement for every house hold to own a fire extinguisher. This is to save lives and to help people financially.",
